{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53490","headline":"滤水罗赋附歌 · 白行简","name":"滤水罗赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉巵无当兮安可拟，风飘有声兮不足比。\n惟滤罗之用也大哉，故去此而取彼。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一一○）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白行简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}